{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"ON ERROR RESUME NEXT\n\nA=1/0\nPRINT A\n\n\nON ERROR GOTO ErrorHandler\n\nX=10\nFOR I = 10 TO 0 STEP -1\n  PRINT X/I\nNEXT I\n\nPRINT \u0022KLAR\u0022\n\nEND\n\nErrorHandler:\n    PRINT \u0022Oj d\u00E5! Ett fel intr\u00E4ffade p\u00E5 rad \u0022 \u0026 ERL\n    PRINT \u0022Felet var: \u0022 \u0026 ERR$\n    END","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}